# To-Do List Web Application

A simple and interactive To-Do List web application built with **HTML5 and JavaScript** for managing daily tasks efficiently.

## Features

* Add new tasks dynamically
* Mark tasks as completed
* Delete tasks
* Real-time task updates
* Simple and user-friendly interface

## Technologies & Tools

* HTML5
* JavaScript
* DOM Manipulation
* Event Handling
* Visual Studio Code
* Git & GitHub

## Project Structure

```text
todo-list-js/
├── index.html
├── first.js
└── README.md
```

